<figure class="viz viz--intergen" data-viz="intergen-flywheel" id="intergen">
  <figcaption class="viz__cap">
    <span class="viz__family">Prosperity → Intergenerational Capital</span>
    <span class="viz__q">Surplus → security → savings → ownership → capability → inheritance</span>
  </figcaption>
  <ol class="intergen-flow">
    <li><strong>Surplus</strong><span>Usable remainder after essentials and obligations</span></li>
    <li><strong>Security</strong><span>Emergency buffer and shock absorption</span></li>
    <li><strong>Savings</strong><span>Liquidity that can become capital</span></li>
    <li><strong>Ownership</strong><span>Home, business, retirement, co-op equity</span></li>
    <li><strong>Capability</strong><span>Education and productive skill assets</span></li>
    <li><strong>Inheritance</strong><span>Next generation starts with a stronger base</span></li>
  </ol>
  <div class="loop-pair" style="margin-top:0.85rem;">
    <div class="loop-card loop-card--power">
      <h3>Prosperity loop</h3>
      <p>
        Retained capital → ownership income → lower essential squeeze → surplus → assets → Arkansas
        capital base → Money Engine strengthens
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="loop-card loop-card--capture">
      <h3>Extraction loop</h3>
      <p>
        Leakage → weak ownership → low household capture → high unavoidable costs → no surplus → no
        assets → dependency → more leakage
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
